OL,3,GNEWSAPC who made false records
OL,4,Acommitted gross misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police constable who
OL,7,Fdeliberately recorded false information
OL,8,Fon police logs would have been sacked
OL,9,Fhad he not resigned, a misconduct panel
OL,10,Ffound.
OL,12,FLiam Yeo, who worked for Thames Valley
OL,13,FPolice in Didcot, Oxfordshire, before
OL,14,Fresigning in July 2025, faced an
OL,15,Faccelerated misconduct hearing
OL,16,Ffollowing allegations that he had
OL,17,F"knowingly made false and misleading
OL,18,Fentries" regarding the contact of a
OL,19,Fwitness.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
