OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPC who made false records
OL,4,Acommitted gross misconduct
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel heard that Yeo subsequently
OL,7,Fadmitted that information he had
OL,8,Frecorded was untruthful, which "would
OL,9,Fhave led to miscarriage of justice had
OL,10,Fit not been highlighted".
OL,12,FYeo was found to have committed gross
OL,13,Fmisconduct and has been barred from the
OL,14,Fprofession.
